# Model roles

Default models for Task/subagent work (unless the user overrides in-session):

| Role | Model | Slug |
|------|--------|------|
| Explore / research | Composer 2.5 (not Fast) | `composer-2.5` |
| Coding / implementation | Grok 4.5 High (not Fast) | `cursor-grok-4.5-high` |

- Do **not** use Fast variants (`composer-2.5-fast`, `*-fast`) for these roles unless the user explicitly overrides in the session.
- If the user names a different model for a task in-session, honor that override for that session/task.
- Parent/coordinator turns use the same defaults when spawning those roles.
